This covers the Guhs mod: its code, models, textures, sounds, music, structures,
texts, wiki and all other files in this repository.
The original guh model was made by Lieke.

YOU MAY
  - download and play Guhs, alone or on your own servers;
  - include the unmodified Guhs jar in a modpack (public or private, free or on
    CurseForge / Modrinth / any launcher). A credit and a link to the official
    Guhs page is appreciated but not required;
  - make and share videos, streams, screenshots and reviews of Guhs, including
    monetised ones;
  - read the source code and build it yourself for personal use, and send
    suggestions or fixes (issues / pull requests).

YOU MAY NOT, without written permission from the author
  - re-upload or redistribute Guhs (or a modified version) on its own, outside a
    modpack, or claim it as your own work;
  - sell Guhs or put it behind a paywall;
  - copy code, models, textures, sounds, music or structures from Guhs into
    another project.

Guhs is a fan-made, non-commercial Minecraft mod. It is not an official
